  14:     - The foreground pixels form one-cell-wide runs using down-right diagonal adjacency.
  15: 
  16:     Rule:
  17:     - For each maximal down-right diagonal run, keep the first pixel in its original color.
  18:     - Walking down-right, recolor the odd-indexed pixels of that run to yellow.
  19:     - Leave the background and even-indexed foreground pixels unchanged.
  20: 
